<title>FRANCE: PARIS BOURSE.</title>
<headline>PARIS BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares were seen opening slightly higher on Tuesday in a rebound to a sharp 1.13 percent fall on Monday, dealers said.</p>
